  "why": "WORKLOAD-1: NVAs must not be migrated in place - the doc's execution pattern is parallel appliance capacity, then shift traffic. Detection is by IMAGE, never by tag (a rule): a marketplace NVA is identified the way Microsoft's own policy identifies one - publisher AND offer together. The offer patterns are meaningless without the publisher gate (they include vm*, linux*, win*).",
